From ada369ea5ee54beb267e11058d3d721745f23f45 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sunshineinabox <aqemail@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 06:54:05 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 16/16] panvk/jm: enable transaction elimination

Enable CRCs on v7 and invalidate them on JM by zeroing the CRC table with
a fill job wherever v10+ invalidates it. The framebuffer descriptor always
reserves the ZS/CRC extension since its use depends on the CRC target
chosen at batch close.
